  reelGuide: ["航带怎么读", "How the reel works"],
  reelRules: ["舵令都以船头为准。读完一拍指针就走到下一拍，读到纸带尽头会绕回另一端。固定镜只折转船头。潮门保留船头和当前指针，反转之后的读带顺序。金色编号标出所选拍在航线上响过的格子。拖回放滑块或用方向键可以慢慢看。", "Orders are relative to the bow. Each order advances the pointer, wrapping at either end. A fixed mirror turns only the boat. An arch keeps the heading and the waiting beat, then reverses how the pointer advances. Gold numbers mark every square that played the selected beat. Drag the slider or use its arrow keys to step through."],
