  reelNote_return: ["守拱人想收一封还带着星光的信。能让船在星戳上掉头，沿来路回拱吗？", "The keeper wants a letter still bright with starlight. Can the boat turn on the stamp and slip straight back into the arch?"],
  reelNote_cove: ["南湾的灯今晚亮着。盖戳以后，能让小船沿 E4、E5 的堤岸回拱吗？", "South Cove has left its lights on. After stamping, can you follow the seawall past E4 and E5 back to the arch?"],
  reelNote_once: ["收信人已经在岸边等了。盖戳后只过一次拱，就停进信箱。", "Someone is waiting on the bank. Reach the box with the stamp and just one arch crossing."],
  reelNote_twice: ["守拱人想听潮声一来一往。让小船恰好穿拱两次，再去靠岸。", "The keeper would like to hear the tide go out and back. Cross exactly twice before docking."],
  reelNote_thrice: ["最后一班邮船还没靠岸。让纸船过三次拱，替它把海上的灯再巡一遍。", "The last mail boat is still out. Cross the arches three times to make one more round of the lights."],
  reelStory_return: ["你寄来的星戳还湿着。小船一盖好就掉了头，连潮水都来不及把墨吹干。", "Your star postmark is still wet. The little boat turned the instant it was stamped, before the tide could dry the ink."],
  reelStory_cove: ["南堤的两盏灯都照进了信封。拆开信，我也陪你兜了一圈。", "Two lamps shone into the envelope as it rounded the southern wall. Opening it felt like taking the long way home with you."],
  reelStory_once: ["只响了一声拱铃，你的信就靠了岸。我伸手去接，船头还有一点星光。", "One arch bell, and your letter was at the bank. There was still a little starlight on the bow when I caught it."],
  reelStory_twice: ["第一声拱铃我在烧水，第二声响时茶刚好泡开。你算得真准。", "At the first bell I put the kettle on. At the second, the tea was ready. You timed it just right."],
  reelStory_thrice: ["我以为第三声还是回音，走到岸边，才看见你的小船在潮里轻轻点头。", "I took the third bell for an echo. Then I stepped onto the bank and saw your paper boat nodding with the tide."],
