  sashesBrief: ["第一缕光落在茶桌上了。橙花杯留给你，蓝纹杯是我的。把两杯都晒暖，再把晨光捎进窗边的信箱。", "The first light has reached the table. The orange blossom cup is yours. The blue striped one is mine. Warm them both, then send the light to our mailbox."],
