  sashGuide: ["窗轨与窗影", "Tracks and tracings"],
  sashRules: ["每次沿轨道推一格。镜片遇到礁石、茶杯、灯、信箱、潮门或其他镜片就会停住。圆镜只在原地翻面。要比较两种摆法，先留窗影，再试推窗。对调窗位会交换两份摆法，也会带回各自的撤销记录。虚线表示留下的光路。", "Each push slides one square. Reefs, cups, the lamp, the mailbox, gates and other mirrors block a slide. Round mirrors tilt in place. To compare two settings, keep a tracing and try a move. Swap settings to bring back the other arrangement and its own undo history. The dashed beam shows the tracing."],
  sashProof: ["这张杯垫上的晨光", "Light printed on this coaster"], sashTable: ["窗边茶桌", "The breakfast table"],
  sashStory_quick: ["你赶在面包凉之前把信送到了。我把脆的那一角留给了你。", "Your letter beat the cooling toast. I saved the crunchy corner for you."],
  sashStory_amber: ["光先落在橙花上。我把你的杯子从窗边推过去，杯柄正好朝着你。", "The light found the orange blossom first. I slid your cup across the sill with the handle turned towards you."],
  sashStory_tide: ["今天的光从另一座拱门探出头来。你比我先看见，我们把杯子挪到了一起。", "The light peeked out of the other arch today. You spotted it first and nudged the cups together."],
  sashStory_below: ["信从窗台下面递上来，还带着一点海风。我双手捧住了它。", "Your letter came up under the sill with a breath of sea air. I caught it in both hands."],
  sashStory_long: ["我们看着光在海上多绕了一会儿。茶喝到第二口，信才到。", "We watched the light take its time over the water. The letter arrived on our second sip."],
  sashStory_free: ["这张杯垫上多了一道金色的印子。下次喝茶，还能顺着它找到今天的窗边。", "A golden line marks this coaster. Next time we pour tea we can follow it back to this morning."],
  sashesMode_relaxed: ["窗台会标出下一次推窗或翻镜，可以随时撤销。", "The window marks the next slide or tilt. Undo whenever you like."],
