  sashesMode_expert: ["使用本站的挑战原图，两片镜改装在横窗上，独立寻找光路。", "Use the station’s expert chart. The twin panes sit in the side sash. Find the light paths unaided."],
  atlasTitle: ["一笔星图", "The star tracer"], atlasService: ["天文台邮班", "Observatory service"],
  atlasAlbum: ["到望海天文台，把三颗星画进同一封信。", "Draw all three stars into one letter at Seaward Observatory."],
  atlasBrief: ["你说星星太小，画到纸上就只剩点。我留了一枚黄铜星钉。今晚，从同一盏灯出发，看看这三个点还能连成什么模样。", "You said the stars looked like dots on paper. I left you a little brass pin. Start from our lamp tonight and see what else those three dots can become."],
  atlasMap: ["天文台描星台", "Observatory tracing desk"], atlasAccess: ["一笔星图。用方向键从笔尖续画，退格撤销。", "Star chart. Use the arrow keys to draw from the pencil tip and Backspace to undo."],
  atlasQuick: ["点亮框续画，按 1、2、3 的顺序去信箱。圆环和星戳可转弯，空白处转弯会用掉唯一的星钉。", "Tap an outlined square to extend the line. Visit 1, 2 and 3, then the box. Bend at rings or seals. A bend in empty sky spends your one pin."],
  atlasGuideTitle: ["潮门与描星规则", "Tide gates and tracing rules"],
  atlasRules: ["从灯的箭头起笔。星线不能交叉，也不能重走旧格。带 ◆ 的一步会用掉星钉，撤回这次转弯就能取回。踏进潮门算一步，会从另一端沿原方向继续。在星图上也可按方向键续画、退格键撤销。", "Begin in the lamp’s direction. Never cross or revisit a square. A ◆ marks a step that spends the pin. Undo that bend to get it back. A tide gate carries you to its twin in one step and keeps your heading. On the chart you can also draw with the arrow keys and undo with Backspace."],
