  atlasStory_bare: ["那枚黄铜星钉还躺在纸边。原来只靠天上的圆环，也能把这封信带回来。", "The brass pin is still on the edge of the paper. The rings in the sky were enough to bring this letter home."],
  atlasStory_short: ["我数了一遍你留下的脚步。今晚这三颗星，再没有更近的走法了。", "I counted the steps you left on the page. Tonight these three stars could not be any closer."],
  atlasStory_rim: ["你把笔尖伸到了纸边。那颗差点落在信封外的星，也跟着信回来了。", "You took the pencil right to the margin. The star that nearly fell outside the envelope came home too."],
  atlasStory_free: ["我把你的图叠在灯下。还是熟悉的三颗星，这次，连起来却像另一幅画。", "I held your page up to the lamp. The same three stars made a different picture this time."],
