  duetBrief: ["先把金色月信和青色星信引到中央的菱形邮戳。盖好合印，可以重新拨一面镜，为两封信各选去向。每走一格用一拍，让两只信箱在同一拍亮起。", "Guide both letters to the diamond desk. Once stamped, you can change one mirror and choose a heading for each letter. Each cell takes one beat. Light both mailboxes on the same beat."],
