  deskReadyAgain: ["这班委托已签收。可重播试航，或换一张工单。", "This order is signed. Replay the sailing or pick another work order."],
  deskGuide: ["调度台使用说明", "How the desk works"],
  deskGuideBerths: ["点圆镜转向。四个锚形泊位任选两个租船，光会沿原方向从另一端接上，过渡不耗拍。已选的泊位可以点掉，也可以收船直航。", "Tap a round mirror to turn it. Pick two of the four anchors to charter a ferry. The crossing takes zero beats and preserves direction. Tap a selected berth to release it, or recall the ferry to sail direct."],
  deskGuideScores: ["镜格右上角的金色三角表示它与开班时朝向不同，每面计 1 工时。租船另计 3 工时，试转、撤销都免费。光沿海图走一格算一拍，两束光取较晚的到站时刻。试航达成委托的两项上限即可签收。", "A gold corner marks a mirror turned away from its starting angle. Each costs one crew-hour. A charter adds three. Experiment and undo freely. Each cell sailed takes one beat. With two beams, count the later arrival. Log a sailing within both limits to sign an order."],
  deskGuideModes: ["轻松档会指引下一步，标准档可按需提示，挑战档换用另一张航图。每档各有一本航簿，三个渡口都能直接值班。", "Relaxed guides each move. Standard gives hints on request. Expert uses a different chart. Each difficulty has its own logbook, and every desk station is open from the start."],
  deskHintBerth: ["点 {cell} 的锚形泊位。", "Tap the anchor at {cell}."], deskHintRecall: ["按「收船」，改走直航。", "Recall the ferry to switch back to direct sailing."],
  deskHintMirror: ["转动 {cell} 的圆镜。", "Turn the mirror at {cell}."],
  deskLetter: ["值班手记", "From the keeper"],
  deskBrief_ferry: ["末班船要走了。今晚有人愿意沿岸慢慢坐，也有人想在舱灯熄灭前收到信。", "The last ferry is casting off. One passenger wants the long way home. Another hopes their letter will arrive before the cabin lights go out."],
  deskBrief_rain: ["雨巷的收信人认得那枚星形邮戳。无论怎么抄近路，记得让光先去街角盖章。", "Someone in Rain Alley knows that star-shaped postmark by heart. Whatever shortcut you take, send the light past the stamp before the mailbox."],
  deskBrief_bell: ["钟响时两岸同时发信。月光要进月亮信箱，星光要进星星信箱。两封都到了，值班员才停表。", "Both shores send a letter at the bell. Match moonlight to the moon box and starlight to the star box. The keeper stops the clock when both arrive."],
  deskNote_ferry: ["散班后，船长在最后一排压了两张票。一张写着「早些见」，另一张写着「陪你慢慢回」。靠窗的位置一直空着。", "After the shift, the captain tucked two tickets into the last row. One said “see you soon.” The other said “take the long way home with me.” The window seat was still free."],
  deskNote_rain: ["打烊时，盖章的人把伞倒过来晾。伞骨上别着一封旧信，星形邮戳早就洇开了，收信人的名字还清清楚楚。", "At closing time the clerk turned an umbrella upside down to dry. An old letter was tucked into its ribs. The star had blurred in the rain. The name was still easy to read."],
  deskNote_bell: ["最后一次停表，岸那边也响起一声车铃。值班员把到站时刻写完，合上簿子，拎起门后那顶一直多出来的雨帽。", "As the keeper stopped the watch for the last time, a bicycle bell rang across the water. They wrote down the arrival, closed the book and picked up the spare rain hat that always hung behind the door."],
